    "title": "Local man accused of stealing beer, hot dogs - NewsBreak",
    "text": "KEY LARGO — A 58-year-old local man was arrested Tuesday, Aug. 5, for allegedly stealing beer, soda and hot dogs from a refrigerator as well as a YETI cooler from the carport of a home. Leland Kevin Broome was charged with burglary and theft, according to the Monroe County Sheriff's Office. Deputies were called to residence on the 95000 block of the Overseas Highway on Sunday, Aug. 3, regarding a burglary. Security footage showed a suspect, identified as Broome as he is known to deputies from prior contacts with law enforcement, taking the items, reports say. Warrants were issued for Broome’s arrest and he was booked into jail.",
